/fast status -> command_output: Fast mode is off.
/fast on -> command_output: Fast mode enabled.
/fast -> command_output: Fast mode disabled.
/fast bogus -> command_output: Usage: /fast [on|ultra|off|status]
/slow status -> command_output: Slow mode is off.
/slow on -> command_output: Slow mode on: requests use the flex tier (lower cost, higher latency).
/slow -> command_output: Slow mode off.
/extended-context status -> command_output: Extended context is off.
/extended-context on -> command_output: Extended context enabled.
/extended-context off -> command_output: Extended context disabled.
